> Conclusion

Exact finite-bank fixtures distinguish signed means from magnitude summaries. Original images and actual noisy points expose domain extrapolation;complete target,seed,scale,clipping and initialization controls show estimator dependence. Smoother-looking maps and MonteCarloSE do not establish causal importance.

> References

- [Smilkov et al.(2017),SmoothGrad:removing noise by adding noise](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03825).
